                    <mxGeometry x="880" y="640" width="200" height="24" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="p4_constraint" value="• RequireAuth.tsx&#xa;    OLD: Navigate to=&#39;/auth/signin&#39;&#xa;    NEW: Navigate to=&#39;/auth/splash&#39;  (state={from} 保持)&#xa;&#xa;• SplashPage.tsx の CTA / link onClick&#xa;    navigate(&#39;/auth/signin&#39;, { state: { from } })&#xa;&#xa;• replace: false (Back ボタンで Splash に戻れる UX)&#xa;&#xa;• SignInPage は変更不要 (既存の from 引継ぎロジック維持)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FAFAFA;strokeColor=#4A3D45;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#262626;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;arcSize=8;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Courier New" parent="1" vertex="1">
